<section id="principal">
    <h2>Message from the Principal</h2>

    <div class="principal-card">
        <img class="principal-photo"
             src="principal.jpg"
             alt="Principal of Ole Tipis Girls High School">

        <h3>Message to Our School Community</h3>

        <p class="principal-message">
            Welcome to Ole Tipis Girls High School. It is my
            pleasure to be part of a community committed to
            learning, discipline, integrity and excellence.
            Our responsibility is to provide an environment
            where every learner feels encouraged to discover
            her potential and work towards her dreams.

            I encourage our students to remain focused on their
            studies, respect one another and participate actively
            in school activities. To our teachers and support
            staff, thank you for your dedication and contribution
            to the development of our learners. I also appreciate
            parents, guardians, alumni and partners for their
            continued support.

            Together, let us continue building a school community
            that values knowledge, character, responsibility and
            service. May every learner leave our institution
            prepared to make a positive difference in society.
        </p>

        <p><strong>The Principal</strong></p>
        <p>Ole Tipis Girls High School, Narok</p>
